  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " is 'others'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "vika",
   "t": "Может, стоит поискать причины в себе?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Maybe you should look at yourself for the reasons?' Let's inspect this part: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "vika",
   "t": "стоит",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " means 'it is worth', so it is 'maybe it is worth'. ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "vika",
   "t": "в",
